---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for wojciech.io — how the site uses Cloudflare Analytics and what data it does not collect."
  canonical="/privacy/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-[var(--space-section)]">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-10">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-custom space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">Analytics</h2>
        <p>This site uses <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to understand aggregate traffic patterns. It does not use cookies, does not fingerprint individual visitors, and does not track behaviour across sites.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Data collected by Cloudflare Analytics is anonymised and aggregated. No personal identifiers are stored or shared. You can read Cloudflare's privacy practices at <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent-hi)] hover:underline">cloudflare.com/privacypolicy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">No tracking cookies</h2>
        <p>This site does not set advertising cookies, retargeting pixels, or third-party tracking scripts. The only client-side storage used is <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">localStorage</code> to remember your theme preference and language choice. These values never leave your browser.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">External links</h2>
        <p>This site links to third-party services (LinkedIn, GitHub, Substack, app demos). Once you leave wojciech.io, their respective privacy policies apply.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about how this site handles data: <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--color-accent-hi)] hover:underline">contact page</a> or directly via LinkedIn.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
